From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:08:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 192/220] [ae-patch] Add Both to Settings > Chat > Spend shows:
 tokens and estimated cost together
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Spend shows offered Tokens, Cost or Off. Both shows the two together ("1.98M tok · $9.80"), and every label now carries its token and cost parts so a card can show them as separate rows. The Agents card's per-session line follows it; its total uses cost only when every session reports one, else tokens. Tokens, Cost and Off show exactly what they did.
